{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "Nevis Search API",
        "description": "\nSearch API across advisor clients and their documents.\n\n* **Clients** are matched by name, email and description: exact, substring\n  (`NevisWealth` \u2192 `john.doe@neviswealth.com`) and fuzzy (typo-tolerant) matches.\n* **Documents** are matched by keyword and by meaning: hybrid full-text + embedding search with\n  domain-aware query expansion (`address proof` \u2192 documents about a `utility bill`).\n* **Summaries** of documents are generated by an LLM when configured, extractive otherwise.\n\nWhen the server runs with `API_KEY` set, send it in the `X-API-Key` header.\n",
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
